Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ATTENDU : 200 OK
### { "dossierId": "...", "documentsEnVigueur": [...], "historiqueOperations": [...] }


### A3.3 Vue Dossier Comptable (onglet 2 : annees x 6 categories)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dataroom/dossiers/{{dossierId}}/comptable
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ATTENDU : 200 OK
### { "dossierId": "...", "annees": [2026], "countsByCategorie": [...] }


