### =====================================================================
### ANNEXE 4 -- Auto-computed Deadlines (Killer Feature §4.2)
###
### Prerequis :
###   - Migration V4__deadlines_schema.sql appliquee (cree la table deadlines + RLS)
###   - ticket-service redemarre apres migration
###   - karim est logge (etape 2) -> @token a jour
### =====================================================================

### A4.1 Compter les deadlines ouvertes (widget topbar)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/deadlines/count-open
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ATTENDU : 200 OK { "count": 0 } (au depart, avant tout calcul auto)


### A4.2 Creer une deadline manuelle
# @name createDeadline
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/deadlines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticketId": "{{ticketId}}",
  "title": "Relancer le client pour la signature",
  "description": "Le client n'a pas retourne les statuts signes depuis 5 jours",
  "dueAt": "2026-06-01T17:00:00Z",
  "severity": "WARNING"
}

### ATTENDU : 201 Created
### { "id": "...", "title": "...", "severity": "WARNING", "source": "MANUAL",
###   "statut": "OUVERTE", "ruleKey": null, ... }

@deadlineId = {{createDeadline.response.body.id}}


### A4.3 Lister les deadlines ouvertes (defaut)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/deadlines?statut=OUVERTE&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ATTENDU : 200 OK { "items": [...], "total": N }
### Inclut la deadline creee en A4.2


### A4.4 Lister les deadlines en retard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/deadlines/overdue?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ATTENDU : 200 OK (vide si dueAt est dans le futur)


### A4.5 Verifier le hook auto sur transition LIQUIDATION -> EN_COURS
###       (Cree d'abord un ticket LIQUIDATION, puis transition)
# @name liqTicket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titre": "Liquidation SARL test deadlines",
  "type": "LIQUIDATION",
  "priorite": "HAUTE",
  "description": "Test du hook auto-deadlines LIQUIDATION_PUBLI_16J"
}

@liqTicketId = {{liqTicket.response.body.id}}

### A4.5b Assigner puis transition EN_COURS
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/{{liqTicketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assigneId": "{{karimUserId}}"
}

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/{{liqTicketId}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "target": "EN_COURS"
}

### ATTENDU : 200 OK
### Effet secondaire : 1 deadline AUTO creee avec ruleKey=LIQUIDATION_PUBLI_16J
### A verifier en A4.6


### A4.6 Verifier que la deadline AUTO a ete creee
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/deadlines?statut=OUVERTE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ATTENDU : 200 OK avec au moins une deadline ou source=AUTO et ruleKey=LIQUIDATION_PUBLI_16J


### A4.7 Marquer la deadline manuelle TERMINEE
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/deadlines/{{deadlineId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ATTENDU : 200 OK avec statut=TERMINEE et termineeAt rempli


### A4.8 Re-marquer TERMINEE -> doit echouer (409)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/deadlines/{{deadlineId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ATTENDU : 409 Conflict { "code": "CONFLICT", "message": "Deadline deja terminee" }


### =====================================================================
### ANNEXE 5 -- Phase 3 : Modification + Dissolution + Liquidation
###
### Prerequis :
###   - Etapes 0-3 OK (token frais)
###   - ticket-service + workflow-service + dataroom-service redemarres
###     (migrations V5/V11/V12/V4 deadlines appliquees)
###   - Un dossier d'entreprise existe (le 1er seede : Atlas Trading SARL)
###
### Capture le dossierId via A3.1 si pas encore fait :
###   GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dataroom/dossiers
###   @dossierId = {{listDossiers.response.body.0.id}}
### =====================================================================


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### A5.1 MODIFICATION : Transfert siege + Augmentation capital
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### A5.1.1 Creer un ticket MODIFICATION (lie a un dossier existant -- pas de companyInfo)
# @name modifTicket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titre": "Transfert siege Atlas Trading + augmentation capital",
  "type": "MODIFICATION",
  "priorite": "NORMALE",
  "dossierId": "{{dossierId}}",
  "description": "Smoke test Phase 3"
}

@modifTicketId = {{modifTicket.response.body.id}}

### A5.1.2 Assigner + transition EN_COURS
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/{{modifTicketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assigneId": "{{karimUserId}}" }

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/{{modifTicketId}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "EN_COURS" }

### A5.1.3 Demarrer le workflow MODIFICATION (4 etapes)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/{{modifTicketId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "MODIFICATION" }

### ATTENDU : 201 Created { "currentStep": 1, "totalSteps": 4, ... }

### A5.1.4 Step 1 -- selection des modifications (transfert siege + augmentation capital)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/{{modifTicketId}}/execute-step
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "step": 1,
  "payload": {
    "selectedTypes": ["TRANSFERT_SIEGE", "AUGMENTATION_CAPITAL"],
    "datePV": "2026-06-01",
    "decisionType": "AGE"
  }
}

### ATTENDU : 200 OK
### { "stepData": { "articlesImpactes": [{ "type": "TRANSFERT_SIEGE", "articles": ["Article 4"] }, ...] } }

### A5.1.5 Step 2 -- saisie des nouvelles valeurs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/{{modifTicketId}}/execute-step
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "step": 2,
  "payload": {
    "valeurs": {
      "TRANSFERT_SIEGE": {
        "nouvelleAdresse": "45 Boulevard Mohammed V",
        "nouvelleVille": "Rabat",
        "dateEffet": "2026-06-15"
      },
      "AUGMENTATION_CAPITAL": {
        "nouveauCapital": 500000,
        "nouvellesParts": 4000,
        "dateVersement": "2026-06-10"
      }
    }
  }
}

### ATTENDU : 200 OK { "advanced": true, "progress": { "currentStep": 3 } }

### A5.1.6 Step 3 -- generation documents (PV + statuts V+1 + JAL)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/{{modifTicketId}}/execute-step
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "step": 3,
  "payload": {
    "pvId": "PV-MOD-001",
    "statutsNouveauId": "STAT-V2-001",
    "annonceJalId": "JAL-MOD-001"
  }
}

### A5.1.7 Step 4 -- validation finale (doit declencher post-completion)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/{{modifTicketId}}/execute-step
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "step": 4,
  "payload": {
    "pvValide": true,
    "statutsValides": true
  }
}

### ATTENDU : 200 OK { "progress": { "statut": "TERMINE" } }
### Effet post-completion :
###   - entreprise_dossiers.adresse_siege = '45 Boulevard Mohammed V'
###   - entreprise_dossiers.ville = 'Rabat'
###   - entreprise_dossiers.capital_social_mad = 500000
### Verifier en DB :
###   SELECT raison_sociale, adresse_siege, ville, capital_social_mad FROM entreprise_dossiers WHERE id = '{{dossierId}}';


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### A5.2 DISSOLUTION : 3 etapes -> dossier passe DISSOUTE
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name dissTicket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titre": "Dissolution Atlas Trading",
  "type": "DISSOLUTION",
  "priorite": "HAUTE",
  "dossierId": "{{dossierId}}",
  "description": "Smoke test dissolution"
}

@dissTicketId = {{dissTicket.response.body.id}}

### Assigner + EN_COURS
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/{{dissTicketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assigneId": "{{karimUserId}}" }

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/{{dissTicketId}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "EN_COURS" }

### Start workflow
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/{{dissTicketId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "DISSOLUTION" }

### Step 1 -- selection societe + motif + date AGE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/{{dissTicketId}}/execute-step
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "step": 1,
  "payload": {
    "dossierId": "{{dossierId}}",
    "motifDissolution": "Cessation volontaire d'activite",
    "dateAGE": "2026-07-01",
    "pvAgeId": "PV-DISS-001"
  }
}

### Step 2 -- validation PV
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/{{dissTicketId}}/execute-step
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "step": 2, "payload": { "pvValide": true } }

### Step 3 -- synthese (declenche post-completion : dossier.statut = DISSOUTE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/{{dissTicketId}}/execute-step
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "step": 3, "payload": {} }

### ATTENDU : 200 OK { "stepData": { "societeStatut": "DISSOUTE", "finalise": true } }
### Verifier en DB : SELECT statut FROM entreprise_dossiers WHERE id = '{{dossierId}}' -> 'DISSOUTE'


### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### A5.3 LIQUIDATION : delai 16j non bloquant + statut LIQUIDEE
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name liqWF
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titre": "Liquidation Atlas Trading",
  "type": "LIQUIDATION",
  "priorite": "HAUTE",
  "dossierId": "{{dossierId}}",
  "description": "Smoke test liquidation"
}

@liqWfTicketId = {{liqWF.response.body.id}}

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/{{liqWfTicketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assigneId": "{{karimUserId}}" }

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets/{{liqWfTicketId}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "EN_COURS" }

### Cette transition EN_COURS pour LIQUIDATION declenche aussi la deadline auto LIQUIDATION_PUBLI_16J (Phase 4 V2)

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/{{liqWfTicketId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "LIQUIDATION" }

### Step 1 -- selection societe + verif delai 16j (non bloquant, warning si < 16j)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/{{liqWfTicketId}}/execute-step
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "step": 1,
  "payload": {
    "dossierId": "{{dossierId}}",
    "dateDissolution": "2026-07-01T10:00:00Z",
    "societeStatut": "DISSOUTE"
  }
}

### ATTENDU : 200 OK
### Si moins de 16 jours depuis la dissolution : { "stepData": { "avertissement": "Delai legal de 16 jours non encore ecoule..." } }

### Step 2 -- generation PV liquidation + rapport
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/{{liqWfTicketId}}/execute-step
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "step": 2,
  "payload": {
    "pvAgeLiquidationId": "PV-LIQ-001",
    "rapportLiquidationId": "RAP-LIQ-001",
    "liquidateur": "Karim Benali"
  }
}

### Step 3 -- validation finale (declenche post-completion : statut LIQUIDEE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/workflows/{{liqWfTicketId}}/execute-step
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "step": 3,
  "payload": {
    "pvLiquidationValide": true,
    "rapportValide": true
  }
}

### ATTENDU : 200 OK { "stepData": { "societeStatut": "LIQUIDEE", "finalise": true } }
### Verifier en DB : SELECT statut FROM entreprise_dossiers WHERE id = '{{dossierId}}' -> 'LIQUIDEE'


